What Are Digital Traffic Safety Solutions?
Digital traffic safety solutions represent an integrated ecosystem of technologies combining artificial intelligence (AI), Internet of Things (IoT) networks, cloud computing platforms, and big data analytics to revolutionize road safety management. These systems enable real-time traffic monitoring, predictive incident detection, automated warning systems, and vehicle-to-infrastructure coordination through advanced ITS (Intelligent Transportation Systems) and V2I (Vehicle-to-Infrastructure) communication protocols.

